      "learningTitle": "Using Verb + Object + Infinitive",
      "learningPoints": [
        "Use verb + object + to-infinitive after common verbs such as ask, tell and want.",
        "Keep the object between the first verb and the infinitive.",
        "Use the base form after 'to'.",
        "Recognise verbs that commonly take this pattern.",
        "Form negative infinitives with 'not to'.",
        "Avoid incorrect patterns such as 'tell to someone' or 'want that someone'."
